*.pyc
__pycache__/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# GPQA Diamond is gated (Idavidrein/gpqa); its terms forbid revealing examples
# in plain text online. Nothing here is committed — the builder
# (scripts/build_gpqa_diamond_dataset.py) is the single source of truth and
# materializes the dataset (parquet + metadata.json) locally / at deploy.
datasets/gpqa_diamond/

# MATH-500 is MIT-licensed and redistributable, but we keep eval data out of the
# repo regardless: the builder (scripts/build_math_500_dataset.py) is the single
# source of truth and materializes it at deploy. Not committing it means we don't
# redistribute, so no third-party license notice is required.
datasets/math_500/

# IFBench is AllenAI's third-party test set; keep it out of the repo like the
# others. The builder (scripts/build_ifbench_dataset.py) materializes it from the
# vendored vendor/ifbench submodule. Not committing it means we don't redistribute.
datasets/ifbench/

# The 7 VLM benchmark datasets are builder-only: a license audit concluded none
# may be redistributed in transformed form from this repo (RealWorldQA is
# CC-BY-ND; the rest have non-commercial / uncleared-image terms — see
# docs/dataset-licenses.md). The builders (scripts/build_<eval>_dataset.py)
# materialize them locally / at deploy from VLMEvalKit's pinned upstream TSVs;
# they must NEVER be committed.
datasets/mme/
datasets/mmstar/
datasets/ocrbench/
datasets/mmmu_val/
datasets/realworldqa/
datasets/mmbench_en_dev/
datasets/pope/

# The 16 ASR datasets (Open ASR Leaderboard, FLEURS) are builder-only too: SPGISpeech is
# non-commercial and GigaSpeech gated (docs/dataset-licenses.md). The builder
# (scripts/build_asr_datasets.py) refuses an output inside this checkout; this
# is the backstop for one copied in. They must NEVER be committed.
datasets/asr_*/
